你费那么多周折来救我，说吧，要我做什么？”她可不相信这个世上会有那么多不求回报的人。无悔老人惊讶于媚儿的态度，不过，还是说出了自己的目的，那双白多黑少的眼眸一寒：“西夏王逼死我心爱的女人和女儿，我要你去杀了他！毁了西夏！”“杀西夏王？毁了西夏？亏你想得出来！”切！来到这破古代，还是逃不了当杀手的命。“我不但把你身上任何印记都抹去了，连你的的脸也都换了，你现在已经完全是另外一个人了，估计连我师兄看到你，也绝对认不出来，所以，你可以用现在这个新的面孔去报仇，帮我报仇，也可以帮你报仇！”媚儿扬唇冷笑：“我会去找商离天和叶子情这对狗男女报仇，但我为什么要给你报仇？”伤害过她的人，她一个都不会放过，他是救了她，但并不代表，他可以利用她！“伍辰儿，你没有别的选择！没有我，你已经死了！是我救了你！”顿了顿，他接着说：“我救你，也就是要让你去替我报仇，你必须得听我的话，要不然……”无悔老人的眼中闪着无数狠戾。“要不然怎样？”媚儿垂下眉头，把玩着垂落胸前的秀发，像是妥协，却不知是为了掩去了那一眸的冷冽，敢威胁她，这老头是嫌命太长了！“要不然，我可以救你，也可以再杀了你！你唯一的办法，就是做我的棋子，为我所用……”他的话还没说完，只觉得眼前一花，跟着喉间一紧！媚儿那纤细修长的素手赫然已掐上了无悔老人的脖子，咬牙切齿阴柔地说：“我媚儿这辈子最恨的就是做别人的棋子，我发誓从今以后，我的命运我自己掌控！”前生伍辰儿就是被商离天当成棋子才会落得剜心的下场，而她在现代，也一直是别人手中一颗杀人的棋子，重生之后，她发誓决不会再做任何人的棋子！银牙狠咬，手上一紧，额前青筋暴起，那美如仙的小脸上瞬间变得狰狞无比，那双勾魂的媚眼底尽是狠意！“你！你！你不是伍辰儿！”无悔老人惊怒无比，他没想到媚儿的力气居然变得如此大，喉间那只手越来越紧，他不敢置信地望着眼前浑身都散发着无边狠戾的媚儿，他敢肯定，伍辰儿没有武功！“你到阎王爷那里就知道我是谁了！”媚儿当然不会给他太多时间去思考来反击，玉手一甩，无悔老人那枯瘦如柴的身子居然被她抛出了窗外！她腾身一跃，也跟着从破窗中跃了出去，在无悔老人还没来不及起身时，一脚踩在他的背上，伸手一扯将他背上的衣服撕了下来，玉手一翻，如一把利剑，直直插进他的后背，扯着他的脊梁骨往上一提！只听到‘咔咔’两声，无悔老人连哼都没来得用哼一声，就那样趴倒在地上，再也不能动弹，他虽然医术高明，但他的武功却在被赶出西夏时尽废了！可能，到死的这一刻，他都没想明白，自己为什么会死在三年来苦心救回来的一颗棋子手里！媚儿这一连串的动作几乎都是一气呵成，干净利落，快得只在一刹那间，这也是她一贯杀人的手法！“师父！”凌风与小仙闻声赶过来一看，却都傻了眼。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/dizhenhuanzhizuidufeifei/6.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "The corners of the lips of the most vicious and wasteful Fei Meier were slightly raised, and the corners of her eyes and eyebrows were full of teasing: \"Really? Destroy me? Are you like this now? There's still a little bit left to be desired!\" Her tone was extremely arrogant. \"You!\" Old Man Wuhui was so angry that he almost stopped smoking. Perhaps, he didn't expect that Mei'er, who had woken up, would be so cold and arrogant. \"Old man, you went through so much trouble to save me, tell me, what do you want me to do?\" She didn't believe there were so many people in this world who didn't ask for anything in return. The old man Wuhui was surprised by Mei'er's attitude, but he still stated his purpose. His eyes that were more white than black were cold: \"The King of Xixia forced my beloved woman and daughter to death. I want you to kill him! Destroy Xixia!\" \"Kill the King of Xixia? Destroy Xixia? Thank you for thinking of it!\" Tsk! Coming to this ancient time, I still can't escape the fate of being a killer. \"Not only have I erased all the marks on your body, but I have also changed your face. You are a completely different person now. Even my senior brother will probably not be able to recognize you when he sees you. So, you can use this new face to avenge me and help me get revenge.\" , I can also help you get revenge!\" Meier raised her lips and sneered: \"I will seek revenge against Shang Litian and Ye Ziqing, but why should I avenge you?\" She will not let go of anyone who has hurt her. He saved her, but that doesn't mean that he can use her! \"Wu Chen'er, you have no other choice! Without me, you are already dead! I saved you!\" After a pause, he continued: \"I saved you, which means that you will avenge me. You must listen to me, otherwise...\" The old man without regrets had countless cruelties flashing in his eyes. \"What else?\" Meier lowered her brows and played with the hair that fell down her chest, as if compromising, but she didn't know it was to cover up the coldness in her eyes. He dared to threaten her. This old man thought his life was too long! \"Otherwise, I can save you, or I can kill you again! Your only way is to be my chess piece and be used by me...\" Before he could finish his words, he felt a blur in front of his eyes and a tightness in his throat! Meier's slender bare hands had already strangled old man Wuhui's neck. She gritted her teeth and said softly: \"What I, Meier, hate most in my life is to be someone else's chess piece. I swear that from now on, I will control my own destiny!\" In her previous life, Wu Chen'er was treated as a chess piece by Shang Litian and ended up getting her heart ripped out. In modern times, she has always been a murderous chess piece in the hands of others. After her rebirth, she swore that she would never be anyone's chess piece again! The silver teeth bit hard, the hand tightened, and the veins on his forehead popped out. The beautiful little face instantly became extremely ferocious, and those seductive eyes were full of cruelty! \"You! You! You are not Wu Chen'er!\" Old Man Wuhui was extremely shocked and angry. He did not expect that Mei'er's strength would become so great. The hand on her throat became tighter and tighter. He looked in disbelief at Mei'er who exuded boundless ruthlessness. He was sure that Wu Chen'er had no martial arts skills! \"You will know who I am when you get to the Lord of Hell!\" Of course Mei'er would not give him too much time to think and counterattack. With a flick of her hand, Wuhui's old man's skinny body was actually thrown out of the window by her! She jumped up and jumped out of the broken window. Before old man Wuhui could get up, she stepped on his back, stretched out her hand and tore off the clothes on his back. She turned her jade hand like a sharp sword, inserted straight into his back, and pulled his spine upwards! He only heard two sounds of 'kaka', and the old man Wuhui didn't even have time to hum. He just fell to the ground and could no longer move. Although he had excellent medical skills, his martial arts were completely useless when he was driven out of Xixia! Maybe, until the moment of his death, he didn't even understand why he died in the hands of a chess piece that he had worked so hard to save over the past three years! Mei'er's series of movements were almost done in one go, cleanly and swiftly, in just a split second. This was also her usual method of killing people! \"Master!\" Ling Feng and Xiaoxian heard the sound and rushed over to take a look, but they were both dumbfounded.", "title_en": "Chapter 6"}